# A shift to the right of a 64-bit integer narrowed to 32 bits brings down none of the bits above them, whatever widens its result afterward.

-- low-byte(0x9e3779b97f4a7c15)
-- low-half(0x9e3779b97f4a7c15)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ low-byte U64
    - state U64

((state as U32) /zrshift/ 24) as U8 as U64

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ low-half U64
    - state U64

((state as U32) /zrshift/ 16) as U16 as U64

